  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 25
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: " How do you know so much about what\u2019s happening?"
    portugueseLine: "Como \xE9 que voc\xEA sabe tanto sobre o que est\xE1 acontecendo?"
    chineseLine: "\u4F60\u600E\u4E48\u77E5\u9053\u53D1\u751F\u4E86\u4EC0\u4E48?  "
    spanishLine: " \xBFC\xF3mo sabes tanto sobre lo que est\xE1 pasando?"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " Ah, my friend, I\u2019m like that annoying uncle who knows everything,
      but never explains how."
    portugueseLine: Ah, meu querido, eu sou tipo aquele tio chato que sabe de tudo,
      mas nunca explica como.
    chineseLine: "\u554A\uFF0C\u6211\u5C31\u50CF\u90A3\u4E2A\u65E0\u804A\u7684\u53D4\u53D4\uFF0C\u4EC0\u4E48\u90FD\u77E5\u9053\uFF0C\u4F46\u4ECE\u4E0D\u89E3\u91CA\u600E\u4E48\u77E5\u9053\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Ah, soy como ese t\xEDo molesto que lo sabe todo, pero nunca explica
      c\xF3mo."
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: " So you\u2019re that uncle who tells the story of the past and
      keeps saying \u201Cah, if I told you, you wouldn\u2019t believe it.\u201D"
    portugueseLine: " Ent\xE3o voc\xEA \xE9 aquele tio que conta a hist\xF3ria do
      passado e fica dizendo \"ah, se eu te contar, voc\xEA n\xE3o vai acreditar\"."
    chineseLine: "\u6240\u4EE5\u4F60\u662F\u90A3\u4E2A\u8BB2\u8FC7\u53BB\u7684\u6545\u4E8B\uFF0C\u8FD8\u603B\u8BF4\u201C\u5982\u679C\u6211\u544A\u8BC9\u4F60\u4F60\u4E0D\u4F1A\u76F8\u4FE1\u201D\u7684\u53D4\u53D4?  "
    spanishLine: " Entonces eres ese t\xEDo que cuenta la historia del pasado y sigue
      diciendo \u201Cah, si te lo contara, no lo creer\xEDas.\u201D"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " Exactly. I\u2019m the uncle with a million stories and no practical
      detail."
    portugueseLine: " Exatamente. Eu sou o tio com um milh\xE3o de hist\xF3rias e
      nenhum detalhe pr\xE1tico."
    chineseLine: "\u6CA1\u9519\u3002\u6211\u662F\u90A3\u4E2A\u6709\u4E00\u767E\u4E07\u4E2A\u6545\u4E8B\u5374\u4E00\u4E2A\u5B9E\u7528\u7EC6\u8282\u90FD\u6CA1\u6709\u7684\u53D4\u53D4\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Exacto. Soy el t\xEDo con un mill\xF3n de historias y ning\xFAn
      detalle pr\xE1ctico."
